PProject plan for Iron OCR demo repo 
Document will plan out building 5 demos within this repository for IronOCR . Each project should take roughly 2 weeks to develop starting 1st October. 

Folder structure Iron OCR code should be stored in its own class along with any core functionality I was to demo , so it is easier for user to separate iron code,  from utility code. Each project subfolder should have its own util class. There should also be util code used by every project in a Utils folder at the same level as the project. Documentation to be stored in their own files in the documentation folders. 1 .md file per project. The readme in the root should contain shared setup instructions as well as brief into to each project, and a link to the individual documentation folder
* Data
   * Subfolder to describe particular test data 
* Code
   * Each feature folder, class with methods, plus a controller to deal with CLI
   * 
   * Utilities folder
Project/Demo 
